# Generated SVGs, CLAUDE.md and llms.txt are compared byte-for-byte by the "regeneration is
# idempotent" step in CI. Without a normalisation rule the bytes depend on which OS ran the
# build, and a Windows checkout reports every generated file as modified with an empty diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
gradlew.bat text eol=crlf
mvnw.cmd text eol=crlf
mvnw text eol=lf

*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
